          "sourceOrdinal": 30,
          "sourcePrintedLine": 13,
          "sourceWithinLine": 1,
          "text": "ਗਉੜੀ ਗੁਆਰੇਰੀ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਕਬੀਰ ਜੀਉ ਕੇ ਚਉਪਦੇ ੧੪ ॥",
          "textSha256": "ead4b50c7b65fe426c1dd00394ed819674cbec95cc0fc779d78e8439f066d2ce",
          "role": "heading"
        },
        {
          "sourceAng": 323,
          "sourcePath": "corpus/ang-0323.md",
          "sourceGitBlob": "8913904f9d203b0f7c82036af9f143fd5c06a8a1",
          "sourceOrdinal": 31,
          "sourcePrintedLine": 13,
          "sourceWithinLine": 2,
          "text": "ਅਬ ਮੋਹਿ ਜਲਤ ਰਾਮ ਜਲੁ ਪਾਇਆ ॥",
          "textSha256": "04c23c17c6efd5fb2db4e36c0fff630fdb85a7deb9f284dedf5ee5f94f0542a0",
          "role": "verse"
        },
        {
          "sourceAng": 323,
          "sourcePath": "corpus/ang-0323.md",
          "sourceGitBlob": "8913904f9d203b0f7c82036af9f143fd5c06a8a1",
          "sourceOrdinal": 32,
          "sourcePrintedLine": 13,
          "sourceWithinLine": 3,
          "text": "ਰਾਮ ਉਦਕਿ ਤਨੁ ਜਲਤ ਬੁਝਾਇਆ ॥੧॥ ਰਹਾਉ ॥",
          "textSha256": "92a0f6e7477a54123307c27bd48ec62e41be624998539f112997aeb77ac9c7f6",
          "role": "verse"
        },
        {
          "sourceAng": 323,
          "sourcePath": "corpus/ang-0323.md",
          "sourceGitBlob": "8913904f9d203b0f7c82036af9f143fd5c06a8a1",
          "sourceOrdinal": 33,
          "sourcePrintedLine": 14,
          "sourceWithinLine": 1,
          "text": "ਮਨੁ ਮਾਰਣ ਕਾਰਣਿ ਬਨ ਜਾਈਐ ॥",
          "textSha256": "926ff5cb92f7b8471472c019418fd15b3cb6055ebde8b210cc035a5241db846e",
          "role": "verse"
        },
        {
          "sourceAng": 323,
          "sourcePath": "corpus/ang-0323.md",
          "sourceGitBlob": "8913904f9d203b0f7c82036af9f143fd5c06a8a1",
          "sourceOrdinal": 34,
          "sourcePrintedLine": 14,
          "sourceWithinLine": 2,
          "text": "ਸੋ ਜਲੁ ਬਿਨੁ ਭਗਵੰਤ ਨ ਪਾਈਐ ॥੧॥",
          "textSha256": "240b04d6db63d8fa2b29f10bf775735296420b0f0eb28b0d9339a702aeca7485",
          "role": "verse"
        },
        {
          "sourceAng": 323,
          "sourcePath": "corpus/ang-0323.md",
          "sourceGitBlob": "8913904f9d203b0f7c82036af9f143fd5c06a8a1",
          "sourceOrdinal": 35,
          "sourcePrintedLine": 15,
          "sourceWithinLine": 1,
          "text": "ਜਿਹ ਪਾਵਕ ਸੁਰਿ ਨਰ ਹੈ ਜਾਰੇ ॥",
          "textSha256": "d656f234e2c99f3c52ab96fa212e3e74a15a8308bfc0689c257608453b6bd4ed",
          "role": "verse"
        },
        {
          "sourceAng": 323,
          "sourcePath": "corpus/ang-0323.md",
          "sourceGitBlob": "8913904f9d203b0f7c82036af9f143fd5c06a8a1",
          "sourceOrdinal": 36,
          "sourcePrintedLine": 15,
          "sourceWithinLine": 2,
          "text": "ਰਾਮ ਉਦਕਿ ਜਨ ਜਲਤ ਉਬਾਰੇ ॥੨॥",
          "textSha256": "51bb0dc783c53394ce8e03d6d7b5721620057b9809182defe276e15112b208e6",
          "role": "verse"
        },
        {
          "sourceAng": 323,
          "sourcePath": "corpus/ang-0323.md",
          "sourceGitBlob": "8913904f9d203b0f7c82036af9f143fd5c06a8a1",
          "sourceOrdinal": 37,
          "sourcePrintedLine": 15,
          "sourceWithinLine": 3,
          "text": "ਭਵ ਸਾਗਰ ਸੁਖ ਸਾਗਰ ਮਾਹੀ ॥",
          "textSha256": "770c5e17401eb428bf0f9ae0a625c2d2c2c3eee3f10c536f14336435bcf5073c",
          "role": "verse"
        },
        {
          "sourceAng": 323,
          "sourcePath": "corpus/ang-0323.md",
          "sourceGitBlob": "8913904f9d203b0f7c82036af9f143fd5c06a8a1",
          "sourceOrdinal": 38,
          "sourcePrintedLine": 16,
          "sourceWithinLine": 1,
          "text": "ਪੀਵਿ ਰਹੇ ਜਲ ਨਿਖੁਟਤ ਨਾਹੀ ॥੩॥",
          "textSha256": "523c26af226e405f17284cfa43efd2bf4ddfe97045eca9050b807ef5ed7a641e",
          "role": "verse"
        },
        {
          "sourceAng": 323,
          "sourcePath": "corpus/ang-0323.md",
          "sourceGitBlob": "8913904f9d203b0f7c82036af9f143fd5c06a8a1",
          "sourceOrdinal": 39,
          "sourcePrintedLine": 16,
          "sourceWithinLine": 2,
          "text": "ਕਹਿ ਕਬੀਰ ਭਜੁ ਸਾਰਿੰਗਪਾਨੀ ॥",
          "textSha256": "0e21e3de7df6936db1ebee28694167fc61d6d20e5a7e83e8bc5f7afddfd92d1a",
          "role": "verse"
        },
        {
          "sourceAng": 323,
          "sourcePath": "corpus/ang-0323.md",
          "sourceGitBlob": "8913904f9d203b0f7c82036af9f143fd5c06a8a1",
          "sourceOrdinal": 40,
          "sourcePrintedLine": 16,
          "sourceWithinLine": 3,
          "text": "ਰਾਮ ਉਦਕਿ ਮੇਰੀ ਤਿਖਾ ਬੁਝਾਨੀ ॥੪॥੧॥",
          "textSha256": "8ed4dc8d09d79fe4b011439ef739f1ee145413fde55c0165228830bf3e92885d",
          "role": "verse"
        }
      ],
