        "sourceWithinLine": 2,
        "text": "ਬੰਨੑਿ ਉਠਾਈ ਪੋਟਲੀ ਕਿਥੈ ਵੰਞਾ ਘਤਿ ॥੨॥",
        "textSha256": "f9312b97a0b94ce0412cc998d0289563b75d966001558a156d94f616d5ab01b0"
      },
      "sourceContext": {
        "previous": {
          "sourceAng": 1377,
          "sourcePath": "corpus/ang-1377.md",
